Changes Tessera made to the fonts in this folder (made by tools/gen-material.sh):

  MaterialSymbolsRounded.ttf  Material Symbols Rounded, Copyright Google LLC,
      Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE-material-symbols). Modified by Tessera: subset
      to the icons listed in tools/material-symbols-map.txt (about 400) and
      renamed "Tessera Symbols" in its name table, so a system-wide Material
      Symbols can't take its place. The glyphs themselves are unchanged.
      Upstream: https://github.com/google/material-design-icons

  GoogleSansFlex.ttf  Google Sans Flex, Copyright 2015 The Google Sans Flex
      Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (LICENSE-google-sans-flex). Modified
      by Tessera: renamed "Tessera Sans Flex" in its name table; the outlines are
      unchanged. The font declares no Reserved Font Name, so OFL section 3
      doesn't require the rename; it keeps "Google Sans" from naming a
      product, as Google's TRADEMARKS.md (in LICENSE-google-sans-flex) asks.
      Upstream: https://github.com/googlefonts/googlesans-flex
